Package: mtd-utils-dbg
Version: 1.0-r1
Description: mtd-utils version 1.0-r1 - Debugging files
 Tools for managing memory technology devices.  This package contains ELF
 symbols and related sources for debugging purposes.
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: GPLv2
Architecture: armv7a-vfp-neon
OE: mtd-utils
Recommends: libc6-dbg, libz-dbg, liblzo2-dbg, util-linux-libuuid-dbg
Source: file://mtd-utils
